scenario: A bear enters the tracking perimeter
id: arch1.bear-enters
kind: nominal
version: 1.0
status: in use
goal: A bear is detected inside the tracking perimeter: predator defense takes over and the drone follows the bear.
description: 1 - Mission orchestrator, autonomous features. One moment of the mission; what leads there is in its preconditions.
author: MBSE Shepherd, Part 3
date: 2026-11-04
tags: part3, architecture 1
given: arch1.mission-start

phase Predator response

  step bear: pasture sends Predator Detected inside tracking perimeter
    note: The bear is seen: Predator Defense asks for control, the orchestrator grants it; the feature drives the tracking.
    then soi.orch is Predator Defense Active
    then soi.pd is Tracking Predator
    then soi.sg is Guard Standby
    then soi.ap is Following Predator
    then message Predator Alert
